  title: 'Modern Migration Waves 20th Century '
  info: "Singapore\u2019s independence and rapid industrialization attracted migrants
    from Asia, Europe, and beyond. Policies encouraging skilled workers brought a
    diverse influx of talents, further enriching the nation\u2019s multicultural
    makeup. Today, Singapore is celebrated as a global city where people of various
    ethnicities coexist harmoniously, contributing to its economic success and cultural
    vibrancy.        "
